[{"answer":"I have a goldfish.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/115-if-my-fish-could-talk-2019-04-07-04-04-11/1.mp3"},{"answer":"He swims around in his bowl all day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/115-if-my-fish-could-talk-2019-04-07-04-04-11/2.mp3"},{"answer":"He looks bored.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/115-if-my-fish-could-talk-2019-04-07-04-04-11/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I look inside the bowl and watch him.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/115-if-my-fish-could-talk-2019-04-07-04-04-11/4.mp3"},{"answer":"His mouth always moves.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/115-if-my-fish-could-talk-2019-04-07-04-04-11/5.mp3"},{"answer":"He looks like he is talking.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/115-if-my-fish-could-talk-2019-04-07-04-04-11/6.mp3"},{"answer":"I imagine what my goldfish would say if he really could talk.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/115-if-my-fish-could-talk-2019-04-07-04-04-11/7.mp3"},{"answer":"I think he would say: \"Hey, I'm bored in this little bowl.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/115-if-my-fish-could-talk-2019-04-07-04-04-11/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Why don't you get me a bigger tank with more fish in it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/115-if-my-fish-could-talk-2019-04-07-04-04-11/9.mp3"},{"answer":"I would like to have some friends to swim around with\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/115-if-my-fish-could-talk-2019-04-07-04-04-11/10.mp3"},{"answer":"I went out and bought a bigger tank for my goldfish.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/115-if-my-fish-could-talk-2019-04-07-04-04-11/11.mp3"},{"answer":"I put some plants at the bottom of the tank,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/115-if-my-fish-could-talk-2019-04-07-04-04-11/12.mp3"},{"answer":"and I got a miniature deep-sea diver to put at the bottom of the tank.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/115-if-my-fish-could-talk-2019-04-07-04-04-11/13.mp3"},{"answer":"I looked into the tank and imagined what my goldfish was saying.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/115-if-my-fish-could-talk-2019-04-07-04-04-11/14.mp3"},{"answer":"He seemed to be saying:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/115-if-my-fish-could-talk-2019-04-07-04-04-11/15.mp3"},{"answer":"\"This is a nice tank.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/115-if-my-fish-could-talk-2019-04-07-04-04-11/16.mp3"},{"answer":"It's roomy in here, and you decorated it well,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/115-if-my-fish-could-talk-2019-04-07-04-04-11/17.mp3"},{"answer":"but I still don't have any friends to swim with\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/115-if-my-fish-could-talk-2019-04-07-04-04-11/18.mp3"},{"answer":"I went to the pet store and bought three more goldfish.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/115-if-my-fish-could-talk-2019-04-07-04-04-11/19.mp3"},{"answer":"I put them into the tank.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/115-if-my-fish-could-talk-2019-04-07-04-04-11/20.mp3"},{"answer":"All of the goldfish seemed to look at each other.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/115-if-my-fish-could-talk-2019-04-07-04-04-11/21.mp3"},{"answer":"They swam near each other and seemed to be playing games.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/115-if-my-fish-could-talk-2019-04-07-04-04-11/22.mp3"},{"answer":"I knew which one was my goldfish because he has a black spot on his fin.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/115-if-my-fish-could-talk-2019-04-07-04-04-11/23.mp3"},{"answer":"I looked at him, and imagined that he was talking again.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/115-if-my-fish-could-talk-2019-04-07-04-04-11/24.mp3"},{"answer":"He said: \"This is great! I have a big new home and friends to swim with.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/115-if-my-fish-could-talk-2019-04-07-04-04-11/25.mp3"},{"answer":"These are nice goldfish that you brought home for me; thank you\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/115-if-my-fish-could-talk-2019-04-07-04-04-11/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Goldfish can't really talk. I know that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/115-if-my-fish-could-talk-2019-04-07-04-04-11/27.mp3"},{"answer":"I just like to pretend that my goldfish talks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/115-if-my-fish-could-talk-2019-04-07-04-04-11/28.mp3"},{"answer":"He seems very happy now with his nice new home, and his new friends.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/115-if-my-fish-could-talk-2019-04-07-04-04-11/29.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't think goldfish can smile either,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/115-if-my-fish-could-talk-2019-04-07-04-04-11/30.mp3"},{"answer":"but it looks like my goldfish has a smile on his face.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/115-if-my-fish-could-talk-2019-04-07-04-04-11/31.mp3"}]
